		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3176&amp;p=25485#p25485"><![CDATA[
A new bug fix Beta is available for the MD9600<br><br>See<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/MD9600/Firmware/Latest" class="postlink">downloads/MD9600/Firmware/Latest</a><br><br>This version fixed the 1750Hz 'tone burst' low deviation bug<br>It also improves APRS deviation <br>And also fixes Tx frequency offsets when transmitting 1750Hz tone or APRS<br><br>Additionally, the calibration screen user interface has been changed so that it is the same as the GD77. <br><br>Thanks to Colin G4EML for his help diagnosing this problem, and to Ian DJ0HF for testing.<br><br>Note.<br>The previous version had a lot of changes.  See details here<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=18&amp;t=3166" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=18&amp;t=3166</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Mon Aug 21, 2023 8:12 am</p><hr />
